comment0.text=\n\ Write\ a\ description\ of\ class\ DNumber\ here.\n\ class\ that\ represents\ a\ number\ by\ storing\ the\ bits\ equivalent\ to\ that\ number\n\ converts\ between\ hex,\ decimals,\ and\ binary\n\ @author\ (Sterling\ D.\ Fields)\n\ @version\ (4/10/2026)\n
